node_modules
npm-debug.log
.env
*.local
data/
*.mcpb
.DS_Store
# store.js's persist() writes here before an atomic rename; a crash between
# the write and the rename can orphan one (hit for real while regenerating
# examples/superglookoquery.db during development — see docs/TODO.md).
*.tmp-*
# A real local archive must never be committed, wherever it ends up (repo
# root during local dev, a stray OMNI_DB_PATH override, etc.) — confirmed a
# real gap 2026-09-10 (a .gitignore audit): only data/ was covered, so a
# stray podquery.db or .sqlite file sitting anywhere else wasn't ignored at
# all. The one explicit exception is the bundled sample database, which is
# entirely synthetic (see scripts/generate-sample-data.mjs) and meant to be
# committed.
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
!examples/superglookoquery.db